<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/assessment-literacy> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "Connects professional assessment knowledge to design, interpretation, and learning improvement." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/assessment-literacy/versions/1> .
